  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Development System Transformation Program (SEFF2 Activity 5)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will finance project preparation activities for the $39.5 million Skills Development System Transformation Program (SDSTP) planned for ADB Board approval in 2026, namely: (i) project due diligence, including seismic engineering resources and assessments on disaster risk management, climate change, safeguards, and economic and financial aspects; (ii) the detailed engineering design (DED) for civil works; and (iii) project coordination. This will ensure the project&amp;apos;s readiness and timely start-up, avoid unnecessary delays, and thereby increase efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
